      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The bug which caused the SDK to lock up was supposedly fixed in 3.6.1\n\nhttps://vrc-beta-docs.netlify.app/releases/release-3-6-1\n\nI'm unsure if the behavior I seek from VRCPlayAudio is possible now, though. Needs testing.",
